// LineChart 的具名分组视觉由 UIX 唯一拥有；Rust 内核负责数据、范围、缩放、平移、刷选、命中和绘制执行。
<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartDefaultsVisual"
  width={300.0}
  height={200.0}
  showGrid={true}
  showDots={true}
  lineWidth={2.0}
  dotRadius={3.0}
  padding={0.0}
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartLayoutVisual"
  titleHeight={20.0}
  subtitleHeight={16.0}
  legendRowHeight={18.0}
  legendSideRatio={0.24}
  legendSideMin={64.0}
  legendSideMax={120.0}
  yLabelWidth={36.0}
  yLabelWidthRatio={0.35}
  categoryLabelHeight={12.0}
  plotBottomReserve={14.0}
  categoryLabelGap={2.0}
  gridMinSpacing={30.0}
  gridMinLines={line_chart_grid_min_lines(4)}
  centerRatio={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartChromeVisual"
  axisStroke={1.0}
  gridStroke={0.5}
  crosshairStroke={1.0}
  brushAlpha={48}
  labelGap={4.0}
  tooltipOffset={12.0}
  tooltipPadding={4.0}
  tooltipEdgeInset={4.0}
  tooltipBorder={1.0}
  dotInnerInset={1.5}
  dotInnerMinRadius={0.5}
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartTypographyVisual"
  title={15.0}
  subtitle={11.0}
  grid={9.0}
  category={10.0}
  tooltip={10.0}
  legend={10.0}
  seriesSeparator="  "
  singleSeriesLegend="数据"
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_MOTION_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartMotionVisual"
  smoothSubdivisions={line_chart_smooth_subdivisions(8)}
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartPaletteVisual"
  background={line_chart_background_color()}
  text={line_chart_text_color()}
  textSecondary={line_chart_secondary_text_color()}
  border={line_chart_border_color()}
  primary={line_chart_primary_color()}
  success={line_chart_success_color()}
  warning={line_chart_warning_color()}
  error={line_chart_error_color()}
  elevated={line_chart_elevated_color()}
/>

<Visual
  name="LINE_CHART_VISUAL"
  type="LineChartVisual"
  defaults={LINE_CHART_DEFAULTS_VISUAL}
  layout={LINE_CHART_LAYOUT_VISUAL}
  chrome={LINE_CHART_CHROME_VISUAL}
  typography={LINE_CHART_TYPOGRAPHY_VISUAL}
  motion={LINE_CHART_MOTION_VISUAL}
  palette={LINE_CHART_PALETTE_VISUAL}
/>

<KernelView value={build_line_chart_view(kernel, LINE_CHART_VISUAL_REF)} />
